WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.229
The three main choices in this module differ in
lifetime and storage A CTE

00:00:06.255 --> 00:00:11.825
exists for one statement A standard view is a
persistent database

00:00:11.851 --> 00:00:17.938
object but it stores the query definition rather
than a result snapshot A

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:23.587
materialized view is persistent and stores the query
result Choose

00:00:23.613 --> 00:00:27.455
among them based on reuse freshness and
computational cost
